  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, if a sparkle princess doesn’t like how her turn went, and she has this trait, she can restart her turn and do the whole thing over at the end of her turn by expending 5 sparkle points. She has full knowledge of the events that transpired during the do over turn, but no one else does. Everything other than the sparkle princess’s memory and her use of this ability revert back to how they were at the beginning of her turn. Sparkle princesses will commonly use battle cries like, “I don’t like that one, let me try again!” or “That wasn’t fair. Do over!”</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/sparkle-princess#toc43\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
